{"t":"Adorned UH Rune Quest","s":"adorned-uh-rune-quest-572ab","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/TripleUHRune2_2d2ff6.jpg","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Adorned UH Rune Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Triple UH Rune Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"timealloc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Est. Length</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5-10 minutes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(40 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.4<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 2, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no legend.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Hero%20Cave\">Hero Cave</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p>Hard creatures, including <a href=\"#/wiki/Hero\">Heroes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Priestess\">Priestesses</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wild%20Warrior\">Wild Warriors</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">Demon Skeletons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord\">Bonelords</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Monk%20%28Creature%29\">Monks</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunters</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragons\">Dragons</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Rune%20Emblem%20%28Ultimate%20Healing%29\">Silver Rune Emblem (Ultimate Healing)</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-quest-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>With the Updates/8.6 the overcharged runes were removed from tibia and replaced with golden and silver <a href=\"#/wiki/Rune%20Emblems\">Rune Emblems</a>. This resulted in the reward of this quest being changed from an <a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Healing%20Rune\">Ultimate Healing Rune</a> with 3 charges, to a <a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Rune%20Emblem%20%28Ultimate%20Healing%29\">Silver Rune Emblem (Ultimate Healing)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h3>\n<p>First of all, you have to go to the Edron Hero Cave, which is here:\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"TripleUHRune2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"278\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/TripleUHRune2_2d2ff6.jpg\" width=\"158\"/></span>\n</p><p>When you enter to the undergrounds, you have to kill some wild warriors.\nGo to the next hole.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"TripleUHRune3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"54\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/TripleUHRune3_7c817b.jpg\" width=\"48\"/></span>\n</p><p>Now you have to kill some Demon Skeletons, Wild Warriors, Prietesses and Bonelords. Go with that way, and go downstairs:\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"TripleUHRune4\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"206\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/TripleUHRune4_00bb15.jpg\" width=\"183\"/></span>\n</p><p>Now you have to go with that way, killing some Monks, Demon Skeletons and Wild Warriors. Go downstairs:\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"TripleUHRune5\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"176\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/TripleUHRune5_5c6410.jpg\" width=\"235\"/></span>\n</p><p>Kill the 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a> and 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\">Dragon Hatchlings</a> and enter that hole:\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"TripleUHRune6\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"126\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/TripleUHRune6_c155f5.jpg\" width=\"182\"/></span>\n</p><p>Now you have to kill one <a href=\"#/wiki/Hero\">Hero</a> and two <a href=\"#/wiki/Monk%20%28Creature%29\">Monks</a>. Go with that way and again, go downstairs:\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"TripleUHRune7\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"68\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/TripleUHRune7_1581f8.jpg\" width=\"120\"/></span>\n</p><p>Now you have to kill some Hunters, Demon Skeletons and Prietesses. Go downstairs. \n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"TripleUHRune8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"63\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/TripleUHRune8_660f74.jpg\" width=\"89\"/></span>\n</p><p>This is the last floor, it containts 5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Monk%20%28Creature%29\">Monks</a>:\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"TripleUHRune9\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"34\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/TripleUHRune9_ff948e.jpg\" width=\"40\"/></span>\n</p><p>The <a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Rune%20Emblem%20%28Ultimate%20Healing%29\">Silver Rune Emblem</a> is in the box.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["beggar-outfits-quest"]}